          },
          "category": "ancestry",
          "description": {
            "value": "<p><strong>Frequency</strong> once per day</p><hr /><p>You can summon a mass of magic energy in your hand that, naturally, you use to smack those who offend you. You conjure forth a spectral bangmangi club for 1 minute, which appears in your hands, though you can give it to another creature to wield. This weapon is a <em>+1 striking ghost touch club</em>.</p>\n<p>At 13th level, the bangmangi is a <em>+2 greater striking ghost touch club</em>.</p>"
          },
